  "description": "Cómo dejar de usar la IA en modo fábrica",
  "body_html": "<h2>¿Cómo estás?</h2><p>Soy Aina y esto es Think&amp;Hack.</p><p>Hay una fricción bastante común cuando usamos ChatGPT, Claude o Gemini: escribimos una pregunta y esperamos que la IA adivine qué necesitamos, en qué contexto estamos y qué nivel de respuesta buscamos.</p><p>No suele funcionar así.</p><p>Una parte importante de la calidad de la respuesta no depende solo del prompt que escribes en ese momento, sino también del contexto previo que le das a la herramienta. Ahí entran las <strong>instrucciones personalizadas.</strong></p><p>Piensa en ello como ajustar el asiento, los espejos y la postura antes de conducir. El coche es el mismo, pero la experiencia cambia.</p><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a class=\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!jCkP!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F09e11b30-1160-4b34-8bda-14ca3effac0a_2752x1536.png\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!jCkP!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F09e11b30-1160-4b34-8bda-14ca3effac0a_2752x1536.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!jCkP!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F09e11b30-1160-4b34-8bda-14ca3effac0a_2752x1536.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!jCkP!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F09e11b30-1160-4b34-8bda-14ca3effac0a_2752x1536.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!jCkP!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F09e11b30-1160-4b34-8bda-14ca3effac0a_2752x1536.png 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\"><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!jCkP!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F09e11b30-1160-4b34-8bda-14ca3effac0a_2752x1536.png\" width=\"1456\" height=\"813\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/09e11b30-1160-4b34-8bda-14ca3effac0a_2752x1536.png&quot;,&quot;srcNoWatermark&quot;:null,&quot;fullscreen&quot;:null,&quot;imageSize&quot;:null,&quot;height&quot;:813,&quot;width&quot;:1456,&quot;resizeWidth&quot;:null,&quot;bytes&quot;:7067120,&quot;alt&quot;:null,&quot;title&quot;:null,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;image/png&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:null,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:false,&quot;topImage&quot;:true,&quot;internalRedirect&quot;:&quot;https://ainalluna.substack.com/i/191735710?img=https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F09e11b30-1160-4b34-8bda-14ca3effac0a_2752x1536.png&quot;,&quot;isProcessing&quot;:false,&quot;align&quot;:null,&quot;offset&quot;:false}\" class=\"sizing-normal\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!jCkP!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F09e11b30-1160-4b34-8bda-14ca3effac0a_2752x1536.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!jCkP!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F09e11b30-1160-4b34-8bda-14ca3effac0a_2752x1536.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!jCkP!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F09e11b30-1160-4b34-8bda-14ca3effac0a_2752x1536.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!jCkP!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F09e11b30-1160-4b34-8bda-14ca3effac0a_2752x1536.png 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\" fetchpriority=\"high\"></picture><div class=\"image-link-expand\"><div class=\"pencraft pc-display-flex pc-gap-8 pc-reset\"><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container restack-image buttonBase-GK1x3M\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke=\"var(--color-fg-primary)\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" class=\"icon-noB79L\"><g><path d=\"M2.53001 7.81595C3.49179 4.73911 6.43281 2.5 9.91173 2.5C13.1684 2.5 15.9537 4.46214 17.0852 7.23684L17.6179 8.67647M17.6179 8.67647L18.5002 4.26471M17.6179 8.67647L13.6473 6.91176M17.4995 12.1841C16.5378 15.2609 13.5967 17.5 10.1178 17.5C6.86118 17.5 4.07589 15.5379 2.94432 12.7632L2.41165 11.3235M2.41165 11.3235L1.5293 15.7353M2.41165 11.3235L6.38224 13.0882\"></path></g></svg></button><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container view-image buttonBase-GK1x3M\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-maximize2 lucide-maximize-2 icon-noB79L\"><polyline points=\"15 3 21 3 21 9\"></polyline><polyline points=\"9 21 3 21 3 15\"></polyline><line x1=\"21\" x2=\"14\" y1=\"3\" y2=\"10\"></line><line x1=\"3\" x2=\"10\" y1=\"21\" y2=\"14\"></line></svg></button></div></div></div></a><figcaption class=\"image-caption\">Instrucciones personalizadas: el hack que casi nadie configura</figcaption></figure></div><div><hr></div><h3>Qué son y por qué importan</h3><p>Las instrucciones personalizadas son un texto que la IA puede leer antes o durante tus conversaciones, según la plataforma. No sustituyen un buen prompt, pero sí ayudan a que la herramienta responda de forma más coherente con tu rol, tu contexto y tu forma de trabajar.</p><p>Bien configuradas, sirven para tres cosas:</p><ul><li><p>Dar contexto sobre quién eres y qué haces.</p></li><li><p>Indica cómo quieres que te responda.</p></li><li><p>Reducir respuestas genéricas o desalineadas.</p></li></ul><p>Eso no convierte a la IA en más inteligente. La vuelve más útil para tu caso.</p><div><hr></div><h3>¿Dónde se configuran?</h3><p>Cada plataforma lo resuelve de forma distinta:</p><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><div class=\"image-link image2\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!lTuD!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F6cc4eb37-4f35-4656-a0b4-8b8d9a06ea75_725x165.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!lTuD!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F6cc4eb37-4f35-4656-a0b4-8b8d9a06ea75_725x165.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!lTuD!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F6cc4eb37-4f35-4656-a0b4-8b8d9a06ea75_725x165.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!lTuD!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F6cc4eb37-4f35-4656-a0b4-8b8d9a06ea75_725x165.png 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\"><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!lTuD!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F6cc4eb37-4f35-4656-a0b4-8b8d9a06ea75_725x165.png\" width=\"725\" height=\"165\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/6cc4eb37-4f35-4656-a0b4-8b8d9a06ea75_725x165.png&quot;,&quot;srcNoWatermark&quot;:null,&quot;fullscreen&quot;:null,&quot;imageSize&quot;:null,&quot;height&quot;:165,&quot;width&quot;:725,&quot;resizeWidth&quot;:null,&quot;bytes&quot;:11628,&quot;alt&quot;:null,&quot;title&quot;:null,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;image/png&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:null,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:true,&quot;topImage&quot;:false,&quot;internalRedirect&quot;:&quot;https://ainalluna.substack.com/i/191735710?img=https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F6cc4eb37-4f35-4656-a0b4-8b8d9a06ea75_725x165.png&quot;,&quot;isProcessing&quot;:false,&quot;align&quot;:null,&quot;offset&quot;:false}\" class=\"sizing-normal\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!lTuD!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F6cc4eb37-4f35-4656-a0b4-8b8d9a06ea75_725x165.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!lTuD!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F6cc4eb37-4f35-4656-a0b4-8b8d9a06ea75_725x165.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!lTuD!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F6cc4eb37-4f35-4656-a0b4-8b8d9a06ea75_725x165.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!lTuD!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F6cc4eb37-4f35-4656-a0b4-8b8d9a06ea75_725x165.png 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\" loading=\"lazy\"></picture><div></div></div></div><figcaption class=\"image-caption\">Instrucciones personalizadas según plataforma</figcaption></figure></div><p>La lógica es parecida, pero la implementación cambia. Y eso importa, porque no conviene asumir que todas funcionan igual.</p><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a class=\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!EaDg!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F02fcef9e-2382-4971-833e-1038e044331b_722x628.png\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!EaDg!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F02fcef9e-2382-4971-833e-1038e044331b_722x628.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!EaDg!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F02fcef9e-2382-4971-833e-1038e044331b_722x628.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!EaDg!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F02fcef9e-2382-4971-833e-1038e044331b_722x628.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!EaDg!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F02fcef9e-2382-4971-833e-1038e044331b_722x628.png 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\"><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!EaDg!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F02fcef9e-2382-4971-833e-1038e044331b_722x628.png\" width=\"722\" height=\"628\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/02fcef9e-2382-4971-833e-1038e044331b_722x628.png&quot;,&quot;srcNoWatermark&quot;:null,&quot;fullscreen&quot;:null,&quot;imageSize&quot;:null,&quot;height&quot;:628,&quot;width&quot;:722,&quot;resizeWidth&quot;:null,&quot;bytes&quot;:31944,&quot;alt&quot;:null,&quot;title&quot;:null,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;image/png&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:null,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:true,&quot;topImage&quot;:false,&quot;internalRedirect&quot;:&quot;https://ainalluna.substack.com/i/191735710?img=https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F02fcef9e-2382-4971-833e-1038e044331b_722x628.png&quot;,&quot;isProcessing&quot;:false,&quot;align&quot;:null,&quot;offset&quot;:false}\" class=\"sizing-normal\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!EaDg!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F02fcef9e-2382-4971-833e-1038e044331b_722x628.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!EaDg!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F02fcef9e-2382-4971-833e-1038e044331b_722x628.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!EaDg!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F02fcef9e-2382-4971-833e-1038e044331b_722x628.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!EaDg!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F02fcef9e-2382-4971-833e-1038e044331b_722x628.png 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\" loading=\"lazy\"></picture><div class=\"image-link-expand\"><div class=\"pencraft pc-display-flex pc-gap-8 pc-reset\"><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container restack-image buttonBase-GK1x3M\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke=\"var(--color-fg-primary)\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" class=\"icon-noB79L\"><g><path d=\"M2.53001 7.81595C3.49179 4.73911 6.43281 2.5 9.91173 2.5C13.1684 2.5 15.9537 4.46214 17.0852 7.23684L17.6179 8.67647M17.6179 8.67647L18.5002 4.26471M17.6179 8.67647L13.6473 6.91176M17.4995 12.1841C16.5378 15.2609 13.5967 17.5 10.1178 17.5C6.86118 17.5 4.07589 15.5379 2.94432 12.7632L2.41165 11.3235M2.41165 11.3235L1.5293 15.7353M2.41165 11.3235L6.38224 13.0882\"></path></g></svg></button><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container view-image buttonBase-GK1x3M\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-maximize2 lucide-maximize-2 icon-noB79L\"><polyline points=\"15 3 21 3 21 9\"></polyline><polyline points=\"9 21 3 21 3 15\"></polyline><line x1=\"21\" x2=\"14\" y1=\"3\" y2=\"10\"></line><line x1=\"3\" x2=\"10\" y1=\"21\" y2=\"14\"></line></svg></button></div></div></div></a><figcaption class=\"image-caption\">Instrucciones personalizadas ChatGPT</figcaption></figure></div><div><hr></div><h3>Qué conviene meter</h3><p>Aquí es donde mucha gente se queda corta. Lo habitual es escribir algo como: <em>“Soy marketer, respóndeme en español y sé conciso”.</em></p><p>Eso ayuda, pero se queda en la superficie.</p><h4>Yo suelo pensar las instrucciones en cuatro bloques:</h4><h5>1. Contexto</h5><p>Quién eres, a qué te dedicas y en qué tipo de problemas usas la IA.</p><p><strong>Ejemplo</strong>:<em> rol profesional, sector, tipo de tareas, nivel de conocimiento.</em></p><h5>2. Forma de respuesta</h5><p>Cómo quieres que te conteste.</p><p><strong>Ejemplo: </strong><em>directo o más explicativo, breve o detallado, con listas/pasos/comparativas, en tono formal o cercano.</em></p><h5>3. Criterio</h5><p>Qué debe priorizar cuando responda.</p><p><strong>Ejemplo: </strong><em>no inventar datos, señalar límites, diferenciar hipótesis de hechos, avisar si falta contexto</em>.</p><h5>4. Protocolo cuando haya ambigüedad</h5><p>Qué hacer si tu petición no está clara.</p><p><strong>Ejemplo:</strong> <em>pedir aclaración antes de asumir, ofrecer dos interpretaciones posibles, evitar construir conclusiones sobre datos incompletos.</em></p><p><strong>Ese cuarto bloque es el más infravalorado. Si no lo defines, la IA tenderá a rellenar huecos por su cuenta.</strong></p><div><hr></div><h3>Un ejemplo simple de instrucciones útiles</h3><p>No hace falta complicarlo demasiado. Algo así ya puede mejorar bastante la experiencia:</p><pre><code><code>Contexto: trabajo en estrategia y comunicación, y uso la IA\npara pensar mejor, estructurar ideas y explorar alternativas.\n\nCómo quiero que responda: en español, con claridad, sin relleno,\ncon estructura y sin exceso de entusiasmo.\n\nCriterio: no des por hecho lo que no esté claro. Si falta contexto,\ndilo. Si hay riesgos, señálalos. Si una idea es débil, explícalo.\n\nCuando haya ambigüedad: antes de asumir, haz una pregunta o\nplantea las posibles interpretaciones.\n</code></code></pre><div class=\"pullquote\"><p>Eso no es un truco. Es una forma de reducir fricción y hacer que la herramienta se adapte mejor a tu modo de trabajo.</p></div><h3>Antes y después</h3><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><div class=\"image-link image2\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!yc8f!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fc257ae3c-1df7-4806-a3ad-e4571d7ee9cd_487x165.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!yc8f!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fc257ae3c-1df7-4806-a3ad-e4571d7ee9cd_487x165.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!yc8f!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fc257ae3c-1df7-4806-a3ad-e4571d7ee9cd_487x165.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!yc8f!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fc257ae3c-1df7-4806-a3ad-e4571d7ee9cd_487x165.png 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\"><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!yc8f!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fc257ae3c-1df7-4806-a3ad-e4571d7ee9cd_487x165.png\" width=\"487\" height=\"165\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/c257ae3c-1df7-4806-a3ad-e4571d7ee9cd_487x165.png&quot;,&quot;srcNoWatermark&quot;:null,&quot;fullscreen&quot;:null,&quot;imageSize&quot;:null,&quot;height&quot;:165,&quot;width&quot;:487,&quot;resizeWidth&quot;:null,&quot;bytes&quot;:8562,&quot;alt&quot;:null,&quot;title&quot;:null,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;image/png&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:null,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:true,&quot;topImage&quot;:false,&quot;internalRedirect&quot;:&quot;https://ainalluna.substack.com/i/191735710?img=https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fc257ae3c-1df7-4806-a3ad-e4571d7ee9cd_487x165.png&quot;,&quot;isProcessing&quot;:false,&quot;align&quot;:null,&quot;offset&quot;:false}\" class=\"sizing-normal\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!yc8f!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fc257ae3c-1df7-4806-a3ad-e4571d7ee9cd_487x165.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!yc8f!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fc257ae3c-1df7-4806-a3ad-e4571d7ee9cd_487x165.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!yc8f!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fc257ae3c-1df7-4806-a3ad-e4571d7ee9cd_487x165.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!yc8f!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fc257ae3c-1df7-4806-a3ad-e4571d7ee9cd_487x165.png 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\" loading=\"lazy\"></picture><div></div></div></div><figcaption class=\"image-caption\">La importancia de las instrucciones personalizadas</figcaption></figure></div><div><hr></div><h3>Lo que no hacen</h3><p>Importa decirlo con claridad: las instrucciones personalizadas no arreglan una mala pregunta, no sustituyen criterio y no convierten a la IA en una experta real por defecto.</p><p><strong>Sirven para orientar mejor la conversación. No para delegar el pensamiento.</strong></p><p>Y ahí está la diferencia importante.</p><div><hr></div><h3>Mi recomendación</h3><p>Si nunca has tocado esta parte, prueba esto:</p><ol><li><p>Revisa dónde se configuran en la IA que uses.</p></li><li><p>Escribe un bloque breve de contexto.</p></li><li><p>Define cómo quieres que responda.</p></li><li><p>Añade una regla sobre ambigüedad y límites.</p></li><li><p>Prueba la misma pregunta antes y después.</p></li></ol><p>No busques la frase perfecta. Busca que la herramienta entienda mejor cómo trabajas.</p><p>El resultado no suele ser espectacular a primera vista. Pero sí se nota.</p><p>Menos respuestas de plantilla. Menos ruido. Más contexto. Más criterio.</p><p>Y eso, cuando usas IA de verdad, importa bastante.</p><p><strong>¿Usas instrucciones personalizadas? ¿Qué cambiarías de tu configuración actual?</strong></p><div><hr></div><p><strong>Soy Aina. Responsable de IA generativa en Planeta.</strong> <strong>Si te ha servido, compártelo con alguien que siga usando la IA “de fábrica”.</strong> </p><p class=\"button-wrapper\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://ainalluna.substack.com/?utm_source=substack&amp;utm_medium=email&amp;utm_content=share&amp;action=share&quot;,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;Compartir Think &amp; Hack &quot;,&quot;action&quot;:null,&quot;class&quot;:null}\" data-component-name=\"ButtonCreateButton\"><a class=\"button primary\" href=\"https://ainalluna.substack.com/?utm_source=substack&amp;utm_medium=email&amp;utm_content=share&amp;action=share\"><span>Compartir Think &amp; Hack </span></a></p><div class=\"pullquote\"><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><em><strong>Cuéntamelo. Siempre leo todo.</strong></em></p></div><p><strong>Fuentes y links</strong></p><ul><li><p><a href=\"https://help.openai.com/en/articles/8096356-custom-instructions-for-chatgpt\">ChatGPT - Personalizar instrucciones</a></p></li><li><p><a href=\"https://support.claude.com/en/articles/10185728-understanding-claude-s-personalization-features\">Claude - Personalización</a></p></li><li><p><a href=\"https://support.google.com/gemini/answer/15575454\">Gemini - Crear Gems</a></p></li><li><p><a href=\"https://openai.com/index/sycophancy-in-gpt-4o/\">OpenAI - Sycophancy in GPT-4o</a></p></li></ul><div><hr></div><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><div class=\"image-link image2\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!KYv_!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F67c58daa-610b-4f97-9d9e-c7a7431183ba_80x80.webp 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!KYv_!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F67c58daa-610b-4f97-9d9e-c7a7431183ba_80x80.webp 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!KYv_!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F67c58daa-610b-4f97-9d9e-c7a7431183ba_80x80.webp 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!KYv_!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F67c58daa-610b-4f97-9d9e-c7a7431183ba_80x80.webp 1456w\" si